    {
      "id": "FaPEI1k8WgPWcFxR-i-Lk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 788.030647822646,
      "y": 278.4338160632117,
      "width": 694.2713623046875,
      "height": 360,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1h",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 893410330,
      "version": 921,
      "versionNonce": 1574452486,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794848504994,
      "created": 1794847507382,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Requirements:\n    - game has 3x3 grid with two players\n    - two players takes turns with making X or O symbols on grid\n    - first player who get three symbols on grid in row (horizontal / vertical / diagonally)\n    - if all cells are filled and no player has won then game is draw\n    - valid the each move\n    - game handles to declare the winner player or draw at end of game\n\n2. Entities:\n    - TicTacToeSystem - main class for system\n    - Game - one game contains - board, players, game_status\n    - Board (grid) - 3x3 cells\n    - Player - holds name, assigned symbol\n    - GameStatus - IN_PROGREES, WINNER_X, WINNER_O, DRAW\n    - Cell - holds the Symbol\n\n3. Class Diagram:\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Requirements:\n    - game has 3x3 grid with two players\n    - two players takes turns with making X or O symbols on grid\n    - first player who get three symbols on grid in row (horizontal / vertical / diagonally)\n    - if all cells are filled and no player has won then game is draw\n    - valid the each move\n    - game handles to declare the winner player or draw at end of game\n\n2. Entities:\n    - TicTacToeSystem - main class for system\n    - Game - one game contains - board, players, game_status\n    - Board (grid) - 3x3 cells\n    - Player - holds name, assigned symbol\n    - GameStatus - IN_PROGREES, WINNER_X, WINNER_O, DRAW\n    - Cell - holds the Symbol\n\n3. Class Diagram:\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
